    <string name="privacy_policy_text">
        <![CDATA[
        <b>Privacy Policy</b><br><br>
        This application respects and protects the privacy of its users. This document describes how personal information is collected, used, and protected when using the app.<br><br>
        <b>1. Information Collected</b><br>
        The app collects personal data provided by the user, including information necessary for the app’s proper functioning.<br><br>
        <b>2. Third-Party Services</b><br>
        The app uses third-party services that may collect information to identify the user:<br>
        • <b>Firebase (Google LLC):</b> Analytics, authentication, and storage.<br>
        • <b>Supabase:</b> Backend and data management.<br><br>
        <b>3. Use of Information</b><br>
        Information is used to improve functionality and user experience. It is not sold or shared with third parties outside the service requirements.<br><br>
        <b>4. Security</b><br>
        Reasonable measures are taken to protect personal information and prevent unauthorized access.<br><br>
        <b>5. Children’s Privacy</b><br>
        This app is not intended for children under 13 years of age.<br><br>
        <b>6. Changes to this Policy</b><br>
        This Privacy Policy may be updated occasionally. We recommend checking this page periodically.<br><br>
        <b>7. Contact</b><br>
        📧 greenmeet26@gmail.com
        ]]>
    </string>

